ed_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Melee attacks work like movement. Just move in your foe's direction, or click it, to attack it.\nIf it is not hostile you will talk to it, or switch places with it.\n\nMelee combat mainly uses five stats:\n* #GOLD#Accuracy#WHITE#: Your chance to hit.\n* #GOLD#Damage#WHITE#: How much damage you do per blow.\n* #GOLD#Defense#WHITE#: Your chance to avoid attacks.\n* #GOLD#Armour#WHITE#: Flat reduction to damage done.\n* #GOLD#Armour Penetration#WHITE#: How much of the target's armour you can ignore.\n\nYou can view those stats, and many others, in the character sheet.\nPress 'C' or right-click your character and choose 'Inspect Creature' to open the character sheet.\n\nYou have spotted some hostile jellies guarding an item.\nAttack them!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"近战攻击类似于移动，向你的目标方向移动或者左键点击就可以攻击它。\n如果目标不是敌对的你会和他交谈或者和他交换位置。\n\n近战攻击主要用到以下 5 个属性：\n* #GOLD#命中#WHITE#：你的命中几率。\n* #GOLD#伤害#WHITE#：你所造成的伤害值。\n* #GOLD#闪避#WHITE#：你躲闪攻击的几率。\n* #GOLD#护甲值#WHITE#：固定的伤害减免。\n* #GOLD#护甲穿透#WHITE#：你可以忽视目标多少护甲值。\n\n你可以在角色信息面板中查看你的这些属性值。\n按 'C' 键，或者右键点击你自己的角色并选择“查看生物”，即可打开角色信息面板。\n\n你发现了一些敌对的果冻怪围着一件物品。\n攻击他们！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"09243c683569ec4a7251d9fbfe9fd6bca8774c8065699dd3fdb8f440afdf81e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f7854cacdfd2668ccd8b4d6538be36a50361b3609c3d24fbe01ad11c74b164d","logical_entry_identity":"20c43ebd04152bc8013b6a0bb45b4669cd4a71575f9f6b8e0dcc55ab8b9dffcc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"All direct healing done to the target is increased by %d%% and each heal restores %0.1f equilibrium.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标所有受到的治疗增加 %d%%，每次治疗恢复 %0.1f 失衡值。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3d2f42b44f3b294c39d586b66213bbc0d84e29df8a2704ff432367a029ad6815","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5f7e92cbfebb8e7cbef8ba7ee3e847f9db607063ab848832d44ff42e60554f44","logical_entry_identity":"906a040539f302943093530faac6c9525f30d4df1a3756dbfb1c6e585ec7b18f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","