come in fewer numbers than ghoul minions but are generally more durable.#{normal}#\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"从古战场中收集白骨，将灵魂附着在白骨上，将其转化为你的骷髅随从。\n\t\t使用技能将会召唤 %d 个等级 %d 的骷髅战士。最多同时掌控 %d 个骷髅战士。\n\t\t技能等级 3 时，你将会改为召唤武装骷髅战士。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时，每当你召唤 3 个骷髅战士，将会额外召唤一个骷髅法师或骷髅弓箭手，不消耗灵魂。如果这超过了你的骷髅数量上限，会移除一个普通骷髅，并返还其灵魂消耗。\n\n\t\t#GREY##{italic}#骷髅的数量一般来说比食尸鬼更少，但是它们一般来说更加强韧。#{normal}#\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"18f5181b53eb03ccadcf6f715266d7aee2278d4dab529d1d725fd94330279035","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"60479170059cd06e16b69a1504ea1707c81dbb0a060bc055fdac4cb5c819e53d","logical_entry_identity":"4b3c9ce710147727b7795d0577aedf4834d0dba2b1d3baea3b06183557b5d66e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Who... Who are you?","source_tag":"chat","target":"你……你是谁？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1d00c36949878225bef67f922218b6202bd2bbe7991dad74edd3ffb34a63c702","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"604dd6e12a0bb9ae9923a30f7886722257c478bfdc92045d0965f81a3109c4c1","logical_entry_identity":"06d08b8385ddaa4e3427e110ea60884c4b5fe6c2c32a4393579ff74981ad9ca8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Know Imbue Item to level 5","source_tag":"_t","target":"学会5级的装备附魔技能"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"89633c2e1f954bef7bad32487064eca5160d9281e48b961f1affa8f990dc566c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"604e5d4e57f6d88f5bea5575bae725bc03525941fd8746b5a6d09ddc9bd5d7b8","logical_entry_identity":"1528764e0b86e471acd27d4a109d93526fa16229a924d2746ccf5e5a7504e10e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and brought back to Vargh for experimentations","source_tag":"_t","target":"并被带去瓦尔弗成为实验对象"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"231cd919d3c2f1a2fe30607790e10e5d1f27d6949856c2ec59837187f2c0ba23","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"605034b16e2a7a7a7bf0e2fce2d56be94909b8a1eda34d4237be223672b84889","logical_entry_identity":"6fcc1515a2f7461d2c65073f6f33a68533e26d3b41d40d1345d1cd7695ab1e45","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","sou